msgstr ""
"Dirige las compras de Learnomy a través del pago de WooCommerce. Opcional: "
"instalar WooCommerce no cambia nada por sí solo. Cuando esté desactivado, "
"Learnomy utiliza su propio pago de Stripe y PayPal."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1475
msgid "Use WooCommerce"
msgstr "Usar WooCommerce"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1484
msgid "Send Learnomy purchases to the WooCommerce cart and checkout"
msgstr "Envía las compras de Learnomy al carrito y pago de WooCommerce"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1492
msgid ""
"When enabled, paid courses and memberships check out through WooCommerce "
"(one dynamic line item per purchase). Requires WooCommerce to stay active. "
"Leave off to keep Learnomy's built-in Stripe/PayPal checkout."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, los cursos pagos y membresías se cierran a través "
"de WooCommerce (un artículo dinámico por compra). Requiere que WooCommerce "
"permanezca activo. Déjalo desactivado para mantener el pago de "
"Stripe/PayPal integrado de Learnomy."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1494
msgid ""
"Activate the WooCommerce plugin to use this option. Learnomy keeps using "
"its own Stripe/PayPal checkout until then."
msgstr ""
"Activa el complemento WooCommerce para usar esta opción. Learnomy sigue "
"utilizando su propio pago de Stripe/PayPal hasta entonces."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1514
msgid "Test Gateway"
msgstr "Pasarela de Prueba"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1515
msgid "DEVELOPMENT ONLY"
msgstr "SOLO DESARROLLO"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1518
msgid ""
"Synchronous in-memory gateway that completes every checkout without hitting "
"an external service. Useful for development, demos, and QA. Turn this off "
"before going live."
msgstr ""
"Pasarela síncrona en memoria que completa cada pago sin acceder a un "
"servicio externo. Útil para desarrollo, demostraciones y QA. Desactívalo "
"antes de pasar a producción."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1524
msgid "Enable Test Gateway"
msgstr "Habilitar Pasarela de Prueba"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1532
msgid "Show the Test Gateway option at checkout"
msgstr "Mostrar la opción de Pasarela de Prueba en el pago"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1538
msgid ""
"When enabled, paid courses show a \"Test Gateway\" option alongside Stripe "
"and PayPal. Clicking it instantly records a completed transaction and "
"enrolls the buyer."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, los cursos pagos muestran una opción de \"Pasarela "
"de Prueba\" junto a Stripe y PayPal. Al hacer clic, registra "
"instantáneamente una transacción completada e inscribe al comprador."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1555
msgid ""
"Add one flat tax rate to every paid checkout, for basic compliance. Need "
"per-region rates, exemptions, or reporting? Use the WooCommerce gateway, "
"which brings its own tax engine."
msgstr ""
"Añade una tarifa fiscal única a cada compra pagada, para cumplimiento "
"básico. ¿Necesitas tasas por región, exenciones o informes? Usa la pasarela "
"de WooCommerce, que tiene su propio motor de impuestos."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1559
msgid "Applies to Stripe checkouts only."
msgstr "Se aplica solo a pagos de Stripe."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1560
msgid ""
"PayPal and other gateways do not add this tax, so a sale paid through "
"PayPal collects no tax. If you sell via PayPal, use the WooCommerce gateway "
"(it brings its own tax engine) or configure tax inside PayPal."
msgstr ""
"PayPal y otras pasarelas no añaden este impuesto, por lo que una venta "
"pagada a través de PayPal no recauda impuestos. Si vendes a través de "
"PayPal, usa la pasarela WooCommerce (tiene su propio motor de impuestos) o "
"configura los impuestos dentro de PayPal."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1565
msgid "Collect tax"
msgstr "Cobrar impuestos"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1573
msgid "Add a flat tax rate to paid Stripe checkouts"
msgstr "Añade una tarifa fiscal única a cada compra pagada en Stripe"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1579
msgid ""
"When enabled, the tax shows on the order summary and on the secure card "
"form, and is charged on top of the price."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, el impuesto se muestra en el resumen del pedido y "
"en el formulario seguro de tarjeta, y se cobra además del precio."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1584
msgid "Tax rate (%)"
msgstr "Tasa de impuesto (%)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1589
msgid "A single percentage applied to every paid purchase, e.g. 20 for 20%."
msgstr ""
"Un único porcentaje aplicado a cada compra pagada, por ejemplo 20 para el "
"20%."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1593
msgid "Tax label"
msgstr "Etiqueta de impuesto"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1598
msgid "What to call the tax on the order summary, e.g. Tax, VAT, GST."
msgstr ""
"Cómo llamar al impuesto en el resumen del pedido, por ejemplo Impuesto, "
"IVA, GST."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1617
msgid "Membership page content"
msgstr "Contenido de la página de membresía"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1618
msgid "The headline, intro, and FAQ shown on the public membership pricing page."
msgstr ""
"El titular, intro y preguntas frecuentes que se muestran en la página "
"pública de precios de membresía."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1624
#: includes/services/view-data/class-membership-pricing-view-data.php:112
#: templates/membership-pricing.php:66
msgid "Simple, transparent pricing"
msgstr "Precios simples y transparentes"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1625
msgid "Leave blank to use the default."
msgstr "Deja en blanco para usar el predeterminado."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1629
msgid "Subtitle"
msgstr "Subtítulo"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1631
#: includes/services/view-data/class-membership-pricing-view-data.php:113
#: templates/membership-pricing.php:69
msgid "One subscription. Every course. Cancel anytime."
msgstr "Una suscripción. Todos los cursos. Cancela cuando quieras."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1639
msgid "Page sections"
msgstr "Secciones de página"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1640
msgid "Show or hide optional sections on the membership page."
msgstr "Muestra u oculta secciones opcionales en la página de membresía."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1644
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "Preguntas frecuentes"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1653
msgid "Show the FAQ section"
msgstr "Mostrar la sección de preguntas frecuentes"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1661
msgid "Gifting"
msgstr "Regalos"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1670
msgid "Show gift redeem / buy-as-a-gift widgets (requires Learnomy Pro)"
msgstr ""
"Mostrar widgets para canjear regalos / comprar como regalo (requiere "
"Learnomy Pro)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1682 templates/membership-pricing.php:198
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Preguntas frecuentes"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1683
msgid "Edit the Q&A shown on the membership page. Blank rows are ignored on save."
msgstr ""
"Edita las preguntas y respuestas que se muestran en la página de membresía. "
"Las filas en blanco se ignoran al guardar."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1696
msgid "Answer"
msgstr "Respuesta"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1698
msgid "Remove this question"
msgstr "Elimina esta pregunta"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1743
msgid "Instructor Permissions"
msgstr "Permisos del instructor"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1744
msgid "Control what instructors can do on your platform."
msgstr "Controla qué pueden hacer los instructores en tu plataforma."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1748
msgid "Self-Publish Courses"
msgstr "Autopublicar cursos"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1756
msgid "Allow instructors to publish courses without admin approval"
msgstr "Permite a los instructores publicar cursos sin aprobación del administrador"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1757
msgid ""
"Turn this off to require admin approval: an instructor's course is "
"submitted as Pending Review, and an admin approves or rejects it from the "
"Courses list. You can also require approval for a single instructor from "
"their profile, even while this is on."
msgstr ""
"Desactiva esto para requerir aprobación del admin: el course de un "
"instructor se envía como Pendiente de revisión, y un admin lo aprueba o "
"rechaza desde la lista de Courses. También puedes requerir aprobación para "
"un instructor individual desde su perfil, incluso mientras esto esté activo."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1765
msgid "Multi-Instructor"
msgstr "Múltiples instructores"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1773
msgid "Allow multiple instructors per course with revenue share"
msgstr "Permite múltiples instructores por curso con reparto de ingresos"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1799
msgid "Revenue split between the platform and instructors."
msgstr "Reparto de ingresos entre la plataforma e instructores."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1804
msgid "Platform Commission (%)"
msgstr "Comisión de la plataforma (%)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1810
msgid ""
"Percentage the platform keeps from each sale. The instructor receives the "
"remainder."
msgstr ""
"Porcentaje que la plataforma retiene de cada venta. El instructor recibe el "
"resto."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1815
msgid "Payout Period"
msgstr "Período de pago"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1820
msgid "Bi-weekly"
msgstr "Quincenal"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1830
msgid "Payment Processing Fee"
msgstr "Tarifa de procesamiento de pagos"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1831
msgid ""
"Take the gateway fee off the top before splitting revenue, so the platform "
"and instructor both share the processing cost instead of the platform "
"absorbing all of it."
msgstr ""
"Deduce la tarifa de la pasarela antes de dividir los ingresos, para que la "
"plataforma e instructor compartan el costo de procesamiento en lugar de que "
"la plataforma lo absorba todo."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1835
msgid "Deduct fee"
msgstr "Deducir tarifa"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1844
msgid "Deduct the processing fee before the commission split"
msgstr "Deduce la tarifa de procesamiento antes del reparto de comisiones"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1849
msgid "When off, commissions are calculated on the full amount the customer paid."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está desactivado, las comisiones se calculan sobre el monto total "
"pagado por el cliente."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1854
msgid "Fee (%)"
msgstr "Tarifa (%)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1860
msgid ""
"Percentage of each sale the payment provider keeps. Most cards are around "
"2.9%."
msgstr ""
"Porcentaje de cada venta que retiene el proveedor de pagos. La mayoría de "
"tarjetas es alrededor del 2,9%."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1865
msgid "Fixed fee per sale"
msgstr "Tarifa fija por venta"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1871
msgid ""
"Flat amount the provider adds per transaction, in your store currency. Most "
"cards add about 0.30."
msgstr ""
"Cantidad fija que el proveedor agrega por transacción, en la moneda de tu "
"tienda. La mayoría de tarjetas agrega alrededor de 0,30."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1875
msgid "Tax in base"
msgstr "Impuesto en la base"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1884
msgid "Include collected tax in the commission base"
msgstr "Incluir el impuesto recaudado en la base de comisión"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1889
msgid ""
"Leave off so tax your gateway collects is set aside before the split and "
"not paid out as revenue. Only matters when a gateway reports tax."
msgstr ""
"Déjalo fuera para que el impuesto que recopila tu pasarela se reserve antes "
"de la división y no se pague como ingresos. Solo importa cuando una "
"pasarela informa sobre impuestos."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1897
msgid "Withdrawals"
msgstr "Retiros"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1898
msgid "Instructor payout thresholds and methods."
msgstr "Umbrales de pago de instructores y métodos."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1903
msgid "Minimum Withdrawal ($)"
msgstr "Retiro mínimo ($)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1909
msgid "Instructors must accumulate at least this amount before requesting a payout."
msgstr ""
"Los instructores deben acumular al menos esta cantidad antes de solicitar "
"un pago."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1913
msgid "Payout Methods"
msgstr "Métodos de pago"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1932
msgid "Bank Transfer"
msgstr "Transferencia bancaria"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1957
msgid "Email Sender"
msgstr "Remitente de correo electrónico"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1958
msgid "Configure the sender name and email for all Learnomy notifications."
msgstr ""
"Configura el nombre del remitente y el correo electrónico para todas las "
"notificaciones de Learnomy."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1963
msgid "Sender Name"
msgstr "Nombre del remitente"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1970
msgid ""
"Shown as the \"From\" name on every Learnomy email. Leave blank to use your "
"site title."
msgstr ""
"Se muestra como el nombre \"De\" en cada correo electrónico de Learnomy. "
"Déjalo en blanco para usar el título de tu sitio."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1975
msgid "Sender Email"
msgstr "Correo electrónico del remitente"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1982
msgid ""
"The \"From\" address on every Learnomy email. Leave blank to use your site "
"admin email."
msgstr ""
"La dirección \"De\" en cada correo electrónico de Learnomy. Déjalo en "
"blanco para usar el correo electrónico del administrador de tu sitio."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1986
msgid "Test delivery"
msgstr "Prueba de entrega"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1992
msgid ""
"Sends a sample email to your account address so you can confirm delivery "
"and the sender identity above."
msgstr ""
"Envía un correo electrónico de muestra a la dirección de tu cuenta para que "
"puedas confirmar la entrega y la identidad del remitente arriba."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2000
msgid "Email Notifications"
msgstr "Notificaciones por correo electrónico"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2001
msgid "Choose which email notifications are sent to students and instructors."
msgstr ""
"Elige qué notificaciones por correo electrónico se envían a estudiantes e "
"instructores."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2026
msgid "Send email notification"
msgstr "Enviar notificación por correo electrónico"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2032
msgid "Custom copy"
msgstr "Copia personalizada"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2032
msgid "Customize copy"
msgstr "Personaliza la copia"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2036
#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of merge tags.
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Leave blank to use the default. Merge tags: %s (plus event details like "
"{course_title} where relevant)."
msgstr ""
"Déjalo en blanco para usar el predeterminado. Etiquetas de fusión: %s (más "
"detalles de evento como {course_title} cuando sea relevante)."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2040
msgid "Subject"
msgstr "Asunto"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2041
msgid "Use the default subject"
msgstr "Usa el asunto predeterminado"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2044
msgid "Body"
msgstr "Cuerpo"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2045
msgid "Use the default body"
msgstr "Usa el cuerpo predeterminado"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2069
#: templates/course/partials/body.php:498
msgid "Student Reviews"
msgstr "Reseñas de estudiantes"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2070
msgid "Control how course reviews are submitted and displayed."
msgstr "Controla cómo se envían y se muestran las reseñas de cursos."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2074
msgid "Enable Reviews"
msgstr "Habilitar reseñas"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2082
msgid "Allow students to leave course reviews"
msgstr "Permitir que los estudiantes dejen reseñas de cursos"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2090
msgid "Auto-Approve"
msgstr "Aprobación automática"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2098
msgid "Publish reviews immediately without manual approval"
msgstr "Publica las reseñas inmediatamente sin aprobación manual"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2123
msgid "Comment Settings"
msgstr "Configuración de comentarios"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2124
msgid "Control whether students can comment on lessons."
msgstr "Controla si los estudiantes pueden comentar en lecciones."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2136
msgid "Enable Lesson Comments"
msgstr "Habilitar comentarios de lecciones"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2144
msgid "Allow students to post comments on lessons"
msgstr "Permite que los estudiantes publiquen comentarios en lessons"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2170
msgid "Defaults applied when issuing verifiable certificates on course completion."
msgstr ""
"Valores predeterminados aplicados al emitir certificados verificables al "
"completar un course."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2174
msgid "Enable Certificates"
msgstr "Habilitar Certificados"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2182
msgid "Issue certificates when students complete a course"
msgstr "Emitir certificados cuando los estudiantes completen un course"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2191
msgid "Footer Text"
msgstr "Texto de Pie de Página"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2196
msgid ""
"Displayed at the bottom of every certificate. Typically your organization "
"name or legal text."
msgstr ""
"Se muestra en la parte inferior de cada certificado. Típicamente el nombre "
"de tu organización o texto legal."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2217
msgid "Quiz Defaults"
msgstr "Valores Predeterminados del quiz"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2218
msgid "Default settings applied to new quizzes. Can be overridden per quiz."
msgstr ""
"Configuración predeterminada aplicada a nuevos quizzes. Se puede anular por "
"quiz."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2223
msgid "Default Pass Mark (%)"
msgstr "Calificación Mínima Predeterminada (%)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2233
msgid "Max Attempts"
msgstr "Máximo de Intentos"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2239
msgid "0 = unlimited attempts."
msgstr "0 = intentos ilimitados."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2243
msgid "Randomize Questions"
msgstr "Preguntas Aleatorias"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2251
msgid "Shuffle question order on every attempt"
msgstr "Mezcla el orden de las preguntas en cada intento"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2259
msgid "Show Correct Answers"
msgstr "Mostrar Respuestas Correctas"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2262
msgid "After submission"
msgstr "Después del envío"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2263
msgid "Only after passing"
msgstr "Solo después de aprobar"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2273
msgid "Anti-Cheat"
msgstr "Anti-Trampa"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2274
msgid "Measures to maintain quiz integrity."
msgstr "Medidas para mantener la integridad del quiz."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2278
msgid "Track Tab Switches"
msgstr "Rastrear Cambios de Pestañas"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2286
msgid "Record when students switch browser tabs during a quiz"
msgstr ""
"Registra cuando los estudiantes cambian de pestaña del navegador durante un "
"quiz"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2295
msgid "Auto-submit after N tab switches"
msgstr "Envío automático después de N cambios de pestaña"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2301
msgid ""
"When tab tracking is on, a quiz auto-submits once the student switches away "
"this many times. Set to 0 to never auto-submit."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el seguimiento de pestañas está activado, un quiz se envía "
"automáticamente una vez que el estudiante se aleja tantas veces. Establece "
"en 0 para nunca enviar automáticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2306
msgid "Default Time Limit (min)"
msgstr "Límite de Tiempo Predeterminado (min)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2312
msgid "0 = no time limit. Auto-submits when time runs out."
msgstr ""
"0 = sin límite de tiempo. Se envía automáticamente cuando se agota el "
"tiempo."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2334
msgid "Rate limiting and caching for the REST API."
msgstr "Limitación de velocidad y almacenamiento en caché para la REST API."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2339
msgid "Sensitive endpoint limit (req/min per user)"
msgstr "Límite de punto final sensible (req/min por usuario)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2346
msgid ""
"Applies to write endpoints flagged sensitive: login, password reset, "
"instructor application, withdrawal request, coupon validate, quiz start, "
"comment post. Set 0 to disable. Max 10000."
msgstr ""
"Se aplica a los puntos finales de escritura marcados como sensibles: login, "
"restablecimiento de contraseña, solicitud de instructor, solicitud de "
"retiro, validar cupón, inicio de quiz, publicar comentario. Establece 0 "
"para desactivar. Máximo 10000."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2352
msgid "Cache TTL (seconds)"
msgstr "TTL de Caché (segundos)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2359
msgid ""
"Object-cache TTL for READ endpoints. Set 0 to disable caching. Max 86400 "
"(24h)."
msgstr ""
"TTL de caché de objetos para puntos finales READ. Establece 0 para "
"desactivar el almacenamiento en caché. Máximo 86400 (24h)."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2368
msgid "Progressive Web App"
msgstr "Aplicación Web Progresiva"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2369
msgid ""
"Offline support and an installable app shell. Registers a site-wide service "
"worker and shows an offline banner on Learnomy pages. Turn this off when "
"Learnomy is one section of a larger site (such as a community) where a "
"site-wide service worker is unwanted."
msgstr ""
"Soporte sin conexión y un shell de aplicación instalable. Registra un "
"trabajador de servicio en todo el sitio y muestra un banner sin conexión en "
"las páginas de Learnomy. Desactívalo cuando Learnomy es una sección de un "
"sitio más grande (como una comunidad) donde no se desea un trabajador de "
"servicio en todo el sitio."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2373
msgid "Enable PWA"
msgstr "Habilitar PWA"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2381
msgid "Register the service worker and offline mode on Learnomy pages"
msgstr ""
"Registra el trabajador de servicio y el modo sin conexión en las páginas de "
"Learnomy"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2393
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Herramientas"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2394
msgid "Diagnostic and maintenance tools."
msgstr "Herramientas de diagnóstico y mantenimiento."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2399
msgid "Send Test Email"
msgstr "Enviar Correo de Prueba"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2403
msgid "Flush Rewrite Rules"
msgstr "Vaciar Reglas de Reescritura"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2424
msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Retención de datos"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2425
msgid "Data retention and cleanup settings."
msgstr "Configuración de retención de datos y limpieza."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2430
msgid "Audit Log Retention (days)"
msgstr "Retención de registro de auditoría (días)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2436
msgid "Entries older than this are removed automatically."
msgstr "Las entradas más antiguas que esta se eliminan automáticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2440
msgid "On Uninstall"
msgstr "Al desinstalar"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2449
msgid "Remove all plugin data when the plugin is deleted"
msgstr "Elimina todos los datos del plugin cuando se desinstala."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2456
msgid ""
"This permanently deletes every course, enrollment, certificate, and "
"transaction when the plugin is removed. It cannot be undone. Leave off to "
"keep your data if you reinstall later."
msgstr ""
"Esto elimina permanentemente cada curso, inscripción, certificado y "
"transacción cuando se elimina el complemento. No se puede deshacer. Déjalo "
"desactivado para mantener tus datos si lo reinstala más tarde."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2480
msgid ""
"Connect Learnomy to e-learning interoperability standards — xAPI, SCORM, "
"LTI, H5P and QTI — and reach each one’s configuration from this single "
"screen instead of hunting across five."
